    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "hW5ht",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Open picks",
      "width": 2668,
      "fill": "$panel",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 14,
      "padding": 48,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "M8SkLl",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "Teacher chat. Picks (decided)",
          "fontFamily": "Literata",
          "fontSize": 34,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UBDoM",
          "name": "Pick 0",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Which concept: 1 Lesson page, 2 Work log, or 3 Newest first. Answer like \"concept 2, board 3\" to point at a picture. Picked: concept 1, Lesson page.",
          "fontFamily": "Literata",
          "fontSize": 21,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "j1ntr",
          "name": "Pick 1",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1. The panel's box on a lesson or cheat sheet page. A: it gives way, the page's box is the one place to type. B: the panel stays its own chat. C: it sends into the page's chat. Picked: A.",
          "fontFamily": "Literata",
          "fontSize": 21,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZTsEV",
          "name": "Pick 2",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2. Model. A: each chat has its own; Settings sets the one new chats and lessons start on. B: one model for both. Picked: A.",
          "fontFamily": "Literata",
          "fontSize": 21,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "HlTf1",
          "name": "Pick 3",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3. Where the card sits in Settings: A, B or C (the bottom row). Picked: A, a Teacher tab.",
          "fontFamily": "Literata",
          "fontSize": 21,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PtfZ9",
          "name": "Pick 4",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4. Steps after a reply. A: gone, as in lessons. B: one folded line that opens them. Picked: A.",
          "fontFamily": "Literata",
          "fontSize": 21,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MwWC7",
          "name": "Pick 5",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "5. A chat made on the other agent. A: it continues on the agent picked now. B: a send asks to switch back. Picked: A, from the chat's summary.",
          "fontFamily": "Literata",
          "fontSize": 21,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "aA7JB",
          "name": "Pick 6",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "6. Get it, when the agent is not installed. A: opens the install page. B: godspeed installs it, with ticks as it goes. Picked: A.",
          "fontFamily": "Literata",
          "fontSize": 21,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
