          "fill": "$dim",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 2272,
          "content": "Option 1, the card in the box's place. The chat stays readable, and today's whole setup card (agent pick, Version, Account) stands at the foot where the writing box goes. A first chat keeps its starters at the top, dim until the agent can run. Once it can, the card folds away and the writing box rises into its place.",
