          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 2272,
          "content": "Option 2, the box speaks. The writing box's place holds one line: what stops the agent and its key (today's compact card), with \"Use Codex\" where the model key goes. After Log in the line says \"Finish in your browser.\" Once the agent can run, \"Ask anything\" fades in in the same place while the line fades out.",
